     "id": 1029025,
     "content_html": "Semi-solid waste is moved by wave-like muscle contractions."
    },
    {
     "id": 1029026,
     "content_html": "Most nutrients are absorbed."
    },
    {
     "id": 1029027,
     "content_html": "Peristaltic mixing occurs."
